# 創刻のアテリアル's ｵｰﾄﾒｯｾｰｼﾞ page, which only AGE 4.38D's 設定 has (docs/engine-re.md, "4.38D's menu bar and 設定
# dialog"): on SC0000's first page the `option` steps set its five controls, each through ｵｰﾄﾒｯｾｰｼﾞの設定 and OK, then
# one on the ﾒｯｾｰｼﾞ page through its own command. Natively AGERC's dialog, on the port the options panel.
#
# - The first `options` lists the sandbox's values. 音声終了まで待つ is on (message:AutoMessageOption=0), which
#   disables the voice group's 文字単位時間, so auto-pitch-voice is not listed until the check is off.
# - The last `options` lists what was set, the same on both targets.
#
# Compare SYS4REG.INI after `stop` on both targets: AutoMessageTime0=900, AutoMessageTime1=1200,
# AutoMessagePitch0=230, AutoMessagePitch1=370, AutoMessageOption=1 and MessageSpeed=30. On a fresh sandbox, on both
# targets:
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game arterial native|port start
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game arterial native|port run tools/drive/scenarios/arterial-auto-options.steps
#   py -3.11 -X utf8 tools/drive.py --game arterial native|port stop

rand-seed 13
wait 5
click adv.next                          # skips the logo
wait-state script=TITLE timeout=90
wait 6
click title.start
wait-state top=SC0000@0xfff timeout=90  # page 1
settle timeout=20

options                                 # the sandbox's values
option auto-wait-voice-end off          # 音声終了まで待つ off enables the voice group's 文字単位時間
option auto-pitch-voice 230
option auto-wait-voice 900
option auto-pitch-text 370
option auto-wait-text 1200
option message-speed 30                 # the ﾒｯｾｰｼﾞ page, from ﾒｯｾｰｼﾞの設定
wait 1
options                                 # the values set above
expect top=SC0000@0xfff
shot arterial-auto-options
